<main id="main"><div class="shell"><section class="section">
  <h1 class="section__title">About Us</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>This is an <strong>unofficial local demonstration replica</strong> of the public pages
    of the National Prisons Information Portal. It exists so that the ERP described in
    <code>documents/erp-scope.pdf</code> can be developed and tested without depending on
    access to a production government system.</p>
    <h3>What this replica is</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>A faithful record of the public field inventory, validation rules and workflows
      of the original portal, captured on 26 October 2026.</li>
      <li>A working local stand-in with its own database of synthetic records.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>What it is not</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>It is not operated by, affiliated with, or endorsed by any government body.</li>
      <li>It does not carry any real prisoner, visitor or grievance record.</li>
      <li>It cannot submit anything to a prison, to NIC, or to any government system.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>See the project <code>README.md</code> for how the analysis was carried out and what
    could not be reproduced.</p>
  </div>
</section></div></main>
